{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05306","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得樽字 · 于经野","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得樽字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御气三秋节，登高九曲门。\n桂筵罗玉俎，菊醴溢芳樽。\n遵渚归鸿度，承云舞鹤骞。\n微臣滥陪赏，空荷圣明恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于经野","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}